The chunk writer’s core looks internally consistent for FLV: grouped chunks use explicit source ranges and output offsets are based on total grouped length. I’m checking the HEVC parameter-set prefix path now, since prefixes change sample sizes and chunk lengths and are exactly where table/data drift can hide.
