codex
[RESOLVED]
- [i2] A2 — custom schemes are now consent-gated, local/script schemes blocked  
  `file/content/javascript/data/blob/about/filesystem` are hard-blocked, `http(s)` opens directly, and other schemes require a dialog naming the scheme and URL before OS handoff: lib/utils/page_utils.dart:437, lib/utils/page_utils.dart:462.

[RESOLVED]
- [i2] A12 — logout uses one cleanup path on all platforms  
  `onLogoutMain()` now calls `clearWebCookies()` then `setAnonymousWebCookie()`; Linux’s no-op is documented because WebKitGTK cookies are injected per window at documentStart: lib/utils/login_utils.dart:49, lib/utils/login_utils.dart:135.

[RESOLVED]
- [i2] A30 — block server parsing now rejects Bilibili-family hosts  
  `parseBlockServer` requires http(s), host, no userinfo, and rejects reserved Bilibili/CDN domains; `_isBlockServer` matches scheme/host/port/path-prefix only after successful parse: lib/utils/accounts/account_manager/account_mgr.dart:231, lib/utils/accounts/account_manager/account_mgr.dart:246.

[RESOLVED]
- [i2] A31 — retried failures now reach later interceptors once  
  Retry failure delivery uses `finish()` so nested retry attempts reject internally while the original attempt calls `handler.next(error)`: lib/http/retry_interceptor.dart:86, lib/http/retry_interceptor.dart:93.

[RESOLVED]
- [i2] A37 — concurrent refreshes are coalesced  
  `_refreshing` shares an in-flight refresh, while `markRefreshStale()` forces a new generation when parameters change: lib/pages/common/common_list_controller.dart:30, lib/pages/common/common_list_controller.dart:40.

[RESOLVED]
- [i2] B16 — FLV/MP4 writer now groups chunks without table drift  
  FLV chunks carry explicit `(offset,length)` ranges, chunk lengths/sample counts are updated from those ranges, and `_write` copies each range into one contiguous output chunk before offsets are assigned: lib/utils/flv_demux.dart:280, lib/utils/mp4_remux.dart:272.

[RESOLVED]
- [i2] B17 — mp4-join coverage added  
  The added test verifies joined samples live exactly at the offsets advertised by the sample tables, plus rejects mismatched track sets: test/utils/flv_demux_test.dart:358, test/utils/flv_demux_test.dart:427.

TOTAL: ROUND-OK
